# inventory at 202 (no room for the Engineer's Gloves: not completed, the oil kept), then 202 with room.
# Jeuno fame 50 (level 2): 33/33/34.
lists UpperJeuno/Collet/onTrigger UpperJeuno/_6s2/onTrigger UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/112 UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/119 UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/202
char zone=UpperJeuno pos=-42.2,0,107.0
fame Sandoria 33
fame Bastok 33
fame Windurst 34
login
trigger Collet                  # Option 0: 112
